{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">網絡近日瘋傳一段車Cam影片，事發於昨日（7日）傍晚 6 時 16 分，地點為西沙 GO Park 對出迴旋處。車Cam車主駛入路口時，驚見一名中年婦人正拉着一輛載有幼童的騎乘車，公然在迴旋處逆線過馬路，過程險象環生。司機見狀立時煞停避讓，而該婦人待車輛駛過後，竟施施然繼續穿過路口。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-08-15h55m27s466.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cBXyVFG9BL1791447458.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-08-15h55m27s466.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\">樓主將影片分享至網絡並反諷留言：「諗諗下我都係有啲唔啱 我唔應該叫佢返上行人路，嚴格嚟講，佢有架人力車，都係道路使用者，婆婆，小妹妹，Sorry🙏🙏」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-08-15h55m34s139.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026N4LkwrngXX1791447464.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-08-15h55m34s139.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left\">片段引發大批網民圍觀及爆眼怒轟，眾人紛紛對該名婦人忽視交通安全與幼童身教的行為表達強烈憤怒，大批網民直指其行為害人害己，留言怒斥：「大教壞細，𡃁妹再大小小以為衝馬路冇問題」。亦有網民指責其無視安全過路設施，留言指：「咁多唔行？」、「離晒大譜」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T08:39:49.331457+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":341,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}